{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1617","id":4085252364,"node_id":"PR_kwDOO5D6p87zgAEM","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1617","diff_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1617.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1617.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/issues/1617","number":1617,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"[codex] Complete #1616 four-paper VLM run","user":{"login":"Samsen879","id":172257175,"node_id":"U_kgDOCkRvlw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172257175?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Closes #1616.\n\nThis PR completes the bounded 9709 VLM completion-first run across the exact four frozen Spring 2022 papers. It produces terminal candidate-only rows for all 34 questions and all 57 prepared regions, while continuing past row-level visual-data defects instead of reintroducing the formal admission gates from predecessor runs.\n\nThe runner validates the four official PDF hashes and every prepared crop hash before dispatch, reserves each attempt before network activity, preserves immutable external request/response packages, normalizes simple representation differences, and records one of the four terminal statuses required by the issue. Candidate content is explicitly non-formal and is not promoted to canonical or production truth.\n\nThe first v1 transport became stuck in an uninterruptible host-kernel `netlink_dump` wait before a response was observable. The repair preserves its bytes, charges its full CNY 1.008 conservative reservation, installs a pending termination/read-only kill-switch, and continues in a v2 lineage over the reachable proxy path. The v2 lineage completed 34/34 usage-covered calls for CNY 0.258732. Total #1616 charged-or-reserved cost is CNY 1.266732; aggregate cost is CNY 1.342577 against the CNY 40 cap.\n\nResults:\n\n- 34/34 terminal question rows across four complete papers\n- 57/57 prepared regions covered\n- 34 `needs_review`; 0 provider failures; 0 silent missing rows\n- 35 attempt records: one conservatively reserved stalled transport and 34 usage-covered responses\n- zero forbidden payload/source/budget/remote/canonical/production/public/sealed side effects\n- compact result, attempt/cost ledger, completion summary, zero-side-effect receipt, and concise report\n\nVerification:\n\n- `PYTHONDONTWRITEBYTECODE=1 python3 scripts/vlm/__tests__/issue_1616_completion_first.test.py -v` — PASS, 10/10\n- `PYTHONDONTWRITEBYTECODE=1 python3 scripts/vlm/issue_1616_completion_first.py run --dry-run` — PASS, exact 34 questions / 57 regions and source hashes\n- `PYTHONDONTWRITEBYTECODE=1 python3 scripts/vlm/issue_1616_completion_first.py finalize` — PASS, exact terminal membership and aggregate CNY 1.342577\n- `node scripts/workflow/cli.js codex-preflight --json` — report/artifact guard healthy; expected warnings only for the task worktree state before commit/upstream setup\n\nNo formal-truth, correctness, official-scoring, rights, publication, canonical mutation, production-readiness, or public-display claim is made.\n","created_at":"2026-07-19T08:26:5